(2220960, 305359, 37252, '<td valign="top">this just isnt getting for me. sorry - but the image looks like snap shot and is very flat. Lacks creativity. If you want to incorporate peanut butter on a spoon, with high heels and your sweet doggie - try thinking of ways to present it in an appealing manner. Have it tell a story.</td>', 'this just isnt getting for me. sorry - but the image looks like snap shot and is very flat. Lacks creativity. If you want to incorporate peanut butter on a spoon, with high heels and your sweet doggie - try thinking of ways to present it in an appealing manner. Have it tell a story.', '2006-03-12 06:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2220966, 305242, 37252, '<td valign="top">This is just unappealing to me - to see toes, including the hairy big toe,  smeared in peanut butter....yuk. Technically it looks grainy, and with uneven lighting.</td>', 'This is just unappealing to me - to see toes, including the hairy big toe,  smeared in peanut butter....yuk. Technically it looks grainy, and with uneven lighting.', '2006-03-12 06:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2220967, 305232, 37252, '<td valign="top">could not even tell if that really is green jello in the background - could be anything. Poorly focused throughout - there should at least be one point of an image that is in sharp focus.</td>', 'could not even tell if that really is green jello in the background - could be anything. Poorly focused throughout - there should at least be one point of an image that is in sharp focus.', '2006-03-12 06:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2220968, 305024, 37252, '<td valign="top">Being so close up did not help you here. All it did was make it harder to interpret your image. I do not find any part of the image to be in sharp focus. The subject matter has nothing to grab my attention or interest.</td>', 'Being so close up did not help you here. All it did was make it harder to interpret your image. I do not find any part of the image to be in sharp focus. The subject matter has nothing to grab my attention or interest.', '2006-03-12 06:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2220970, 305409, 37252, '<td valign="top">Not a winner in my book - sorry but seeing green jello on the tip of your tongue and a finger rammed up your nose is very un-appealing. I will say you have demonstrated a very good DOF here. For that I give you 2 points</td>', 'Not a winner in my book - sorry but seeing green jello on the tip of your tongue and a finger rammed up your nose is very un-appealing. I will say you have demonstrated a very good DOF here. For that I give you 2 points', '2006-03-12 06:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
