(2221055, 305237, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice selective desat... I would have cropped out the right half of the image (the blurry foot) and drawn more attention to the fancy shoe &amp; PB.  It would have been stronger, I think.</td>', 'Nice selective desat... I would have cropped out the right half of the image (the blurry foot) and drawn more attention to the fancy shoe & PB.  It would have been stronger, I think.', '2006-03-12 07:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
