(2221057, 305288, 44242, '<td valign="top">Good control over lighting and exposure. one of my top 3. slight lack fo sharpness, but overall very nice ''old school'' look.</td>', 'Good control over lighting and exposure. one of my top 3. slight lack fo sharpness, but overall very nice ''old school'' look.', '2006-03-12 07:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
