(2221382, 305411, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the single saturation of the yellow but with it were just a tad brighter.  But the whites are kind of blown, so the brighter yellow might ruin it.  I think I''d like just a bit more depth for the whole shot with an adjustment of levels.  But that''s just my taste.   The composition is good and I like the composition crop you chose. Like the shoes are floating (I did shoes and a bike wheel too)<br/> <br/>GOOD LUCK</td>', 'I like the single saturation of the yellow but with it were just a tad brighter.  But the whites are kind of blown, so the brighter yellow might ruin it.  I think I''d like just a bit more depth for the whole shot with an adjustment of levels.  But that''s just my taste.   The composition is good and I like the composition crop you chose. Like the shoes are floating (I did shoes and a bike wheel too) GOOD LUCK', '2006-03-12 10:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221385, 305297, 40667, '<td valign="top">really nice, i might have gone a bit higher on the contrast, and cloned a couple inperfections out of the heels. Nice overall photo though</td>', 'really nice, i might have gone a bit higher on the contrast, and cloned a couple inperfections out of the heels. Nice overall photo though', '2006-03-12 10:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221386, 305216, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like maybe one of the shoes laying over on the side, so they aren''t just lined up like little soldiers. Or, maybe if she were wearing the shoes. The overall paleness works. Nice curve of the woman''s back.</td>', 'I think I''d like maybe one of the shoes laying over on the side, so they aren''t just lined up like little soldiers. Or, maybe if she were wearing the shoes. The overall paleness works. Nice curve of the woman''s back.', '2006-03-12 10:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221388, 305398, 15711, '<td valign="top">I find the floor and the grate extremely disassociated from the overall image. A solid white backdrop would have really showcased the black shoes and the vibrancy of the feather.</td>', 'I find the floor and the grate extremely disassociated from the overall image. A solid white backdrop would have really showcased the black shoes and the vibrancy of the feather.', '2006-03-12 10:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221389, 305268, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish the feathers were more artfully placed. They seem kind of randomly scattered.  I wonder if a black backdrop would have showcased the glasses better? Hmmmm - good luck on your entry.</td>', 'I wish the feathers were more artfully placed. They seem kind of randomly scattered.  I wonder if a black backdrop would have showcased the glasses better? Hmmmm - good luck on your entry.', '2006-03-12 10:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221390, 305173, 40667, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The only couple things that really could have been improved here are the  siloette background, and the blur at the top of the photo is just a bit distracting. When you start to see the blur, you expect to follow it all the way down. nice job</td>', 'Very nice. The only couple things that really could have been improved here are the  siloette background, and the blur at the top of the photo is just a bit distracting. When you start to see the blur, you expect to follow it all the way down. nice job', '2006-03-12 10:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221393, 305371, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is the most natural of all the entries.  The hint of pink works. I''m wondering if maybe the background being a bit lighter might''ve worked better.  Possily some dodge on the trees?  Nice off centered placement of the subject. I wish we could see a bit more of her face. 7</td>', 'This is the most natural of all the entries.  The hint of pink works. I''m wondering if maybe the background being a bit lighter might''ve worked better.  Possily some dodge on the trees?  Nice off centered placement of the subject. I wish we could see a bit more of her face. 7', '2006-03-12 10:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221394, 305188, 15711, '<td valign="top">Yum!!! NOT (I usually hate "staged" shots, but for some reason, this is believable. )I think a white plate would have really made it perfect. Nice clear focus and the composition works as well. 7</td>', 'Yum!!! NOT (I usually hate "staged" shots, but for some reason, this is believable. )I think a white plate would have really made it perfect. Nice clear focus and the composition works as well. 7', '2006-03-12 10:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221395, 305108, 40667, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail on the rim and wheel! I wish we could have seen it in the feather, but other than that your DOF is spot on</td>', 'Very nice detail on the rim and wheel! I wish we could have seen it in the feather, but other than that your DOF is spot on', '2006-03-12 10:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221396, 305305, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. Good idea. I think it has to much space given up to the feathers. On my monitor, they lack detail and by the title I suppose that is the desired effect but there''s just to much lost space. I''m giving a higher score, but would like to mention a couple other things that could be improved. The creases in the camera left shoe might be cloned out and there is someting under the heel on camera right. If that is just a shadow, I''d clone it so it''s uniform.</td>', 'This is lovely. Good idea. I think it has to much space given up to the feathers. On my monitor, they lack detail and by the title I suppose that is the desired effect but there''s just to much lost space. I''m giving a higher score, but would like to mention a couple other things that could be improved. The creases in the camera left shoe might be cloned out and there is someting under the heel on camera right. If that is just a shadow, I''d clone it so it''s uniform.', '2006-03-12 10:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221398, 305345, 40667, '<td valign="top">Nice composure! very creative, wish you had bumped your brightness/contrast a bit more to make it really stand out</td>', 'Nice composure! very creative, wish you had bumped your brightness/contrast a bit more to make it really stand out', '2006-03-12 10:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
