(2221405, 305237, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I think I''d like the peanut butter jar to be black and white as well. Being in color, it draws the eye to the distracting floor squares. Clever though, with the movement stopped - and the blur of the one foot.</td>', 'Interesting.  I think I''d like the peanut butter jar to be black and white as well. Being in color, it draws the eye to the distracting floor squares. Clever though, with the movement stopped - and the blur of the one foot.', '2006-03-12 10:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
