(2221409, 305325, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the blouse just puts the pink theme over the top for me. I''d like to see her wearing something black, so that her upper body just fades into the background.  Maybe take off the earring and the lipstick, so the feathers are the main focus.  AS it is, they kind of get lost in the shuffle.  The focus is spot on and I love her braids. If she were wearing black, then I''d have one over her shoulder to show it off more. In fact, I''d take off the hat too. LOL One hot pink feather with the glasses would really make a stronger statement in its simplicity.  Sorry, I''m rambling but people ask for detailed critiques, so I guess you got one.  Best of luck!</td>', 'I think the blouse just puts the pink theme over the top for me. I''d like to see her wearing something black, so that her upper body just fades into the background.  Maybe take off the earring and the lipstick, so the feathers are the main focus.  AS it is, they kind of get lost in the shuffle.  The focus is spot on and I love her braids. If she were wearing black, then I''d have one over her shoulder to show it off more. In fact, I''d take off the hat too. LOL One hot pink feather with the glasses would really make a stronger statement in its simplicity.  Sorry, I''m rambling but people ask for detailed critiques, so I guess you got one.  Best of luck!', '2006-03-12 10:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
