(2221511, 305433, 11800, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea and it''s set up so the pb cherry and jello look good. The major problem with the picture, to me, is the color. Looks like there is an orange color cast. That would be ok but in this case, it makes the jello look dull and gives a general dull look  to the rest of the frame.<br/>If you cover the front of the tripod with a black foamboard or cloth, you will cut down the reflection.</td>', 'This was a good idea and it''s set up so the pb cherry and jello look good. The major problem with the picture, to me, is the color. Looks like there is an orange color cast. That would be ok but in this case, it makes the jello look dull and gives a general dull look  to the rest of the frame.If you cover the front of the tripod with a black foamboard or cloth, you will cut down the reflection.', '2006-03-12 11:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
