(2221661, 305305, 19959, '<td valign="top">Very nice, well thought out and executed. Very few entries only feature the two items and nothing else. This is my pick for a ribbon.</td>', 'Very nice, well thought out and executed. Very few entries only feature the two items and nothing else. This is my pick for a ribbon.', '2006-03-12 12:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
