(2221845, 305339, 50075, '<td valign="top">I love the variations in red/brown hues. The glasses bring attention to a killer set of eyes and the feather covering the mouth emphesizes words softly spoken. There''s one thing in the shot that my eye gets drawn to that seems a distraction and that''s the bit of background showing at the upper left. Maybe intentional, maybe not. Either way, very well done.</td>', 'I love the variations in red/brown hues. The glasses bring attention to a killer set of eyes and the feather covering the mouth emphesizes words softly spoken. There''s one thing in the shot that my eye gets drawn to that seems a distraction and that''s the bit of background showing at the upper left. Maybe intentional, maybe not. Either way, very well done.', '2006-03-12 13:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221852, 305388, 34213, '<td valign="top">That fits.  Creative.</td>', 'That fits.  Creative.', '2006-03-12 13:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221853, 305325, 50075, '<td valign="top">It looks like she had a lot of fun doing this. Everything works so well. The orange feather and subdued pink earring are great ways to bring in different colors. Nice job!</td>', 'It looks like she had a lot of fun doing this. Everything works so well. The orange feather and subdued pink earring are great ways to bring in different colors. Nice job!', '2006-03-12 13:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
