(2221895, 305371, 17851, '<td valign="top">great job ;)</td>', 'great job ;)', '2006-03-12 14:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221911, 305300, 45790, '<td valign="top">Well it doesn''t look sharp and it seems poorly lit, but that''s all part of the historic charm.</td>', 'Well it doesn''t look sharp and it seems poorly lit, but that''s all part of the historic charm.', '2006-03-12 14:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221915, 305360, 45790, '<td valign="top">Could use a little more DOF because the grass looks strange in the foreground. (Looks like a fuzzy carpet)</td>', 'Could use a little more DOF because the grass looks strange in the foreground. (Looks like a fuzzy carpet)', '2006-03-12 14:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221917, 305297, 45790, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup, great lighting and composition.</td>', 'Very nice setup, great lighting and composition.', '2006-03-12 14:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221921, 305362, 45790, '<td valign="top">I like it, but it needs more contrast between the shoes and the background -- they blend together on my monitor.</td>', 'I like it, but it needs more contrast between the shoes and the background -- they blend together on my monitor.', '2006-03-12 14:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221924, 305367, 7322, '<td valign="top">Yum...? This is well done but I think I would like to see the whole glass. I''m not getting the choice to crop the bottom out. I could be wrong though.</td>', 'Yum...? This is well done but I think I would like to see the whole glass. I''m not getting the choice to crop the bottom out. I could be wrong though.', '2006-03-12 14:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221925, 305289, 45790, '<td valign="top">Better watch where you place your right hand! Great job (as usual).</td>', 'Better watch where you place your right hand! Great job (as usual).', '2006-03-12 14:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221930, 305289, 12253, '<td valign="top">Just too funny Leroy!  10 from me.</td>', 'Just too funny Leroy!  10 from me.', '2006-03-12 14:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221931, 305417, 7322, '<td valign="top">The cropping is a bit squeezed looking to me. I think it would be better if the shoe that the dog''s head is resting on were turned so we see more of the interesting part of the shoe instead of the sole. It''s a cute idea and I like the exposure.</td>', 'The cropping is a bit squeezed looking to me. I think it would be better if the shoe that the dog''s head is resting on were turned so we see more of the interesting part of the shoe instead of the sole. It''s a cute idea and I like the exposure.', '2006-03-12 14:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221937, 305057, 5728, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2006-03-12 14:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221943, 305388, 7322, '<td valign="top">eeyeew...That is just too disturbing. That poor model had to smell peanut butter and lime jello for how long? Nauseating. The composition is striking and I like the exposure that you got for the jello--how it shows her eyelashes. The shiny peanut butter is just too gross for me to really like this picture. But I have a very strong aversion to the seeing food on people''s faces. Even a little peanut butter on someones lips can make my stomach heave a bit. No kidding. <br/> <br/>I bet this was a good facial for her. Lots of healthy fats. :D <br/> <br/>Good job.</td>', 'eeyeew...That is just too disturbing. That poor model had to smell peanut butter and lime jello for how long? Nauseating. The composition is striking and I like the exposure that you got for the jello--how it shows her eyelashes. The shiny peanut butter is just too gross for me to really like this picture. But I have a very strong aversion to the seeing food on people''s faces. Even a little peanut butter on someones lips can make my stomach heave a bit. No kidding.  I bet this was a good facial for her. Lots of healthy fats. :D  Good job.', '2006-03-12 14:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221945, 305072, 7322, '<td valign="top">Pretty, imaginative and simple. It looks like it could be a bit sharper though, especially on the jello mold. I hate borders generally but this one works for me.</td>', 'Pretty, imaginative and simple. It looks like it could be a bit sharper though, especially on the jello mold. I hate borders generally but this one works for me.', '2006-03-12 14:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221949, 305088, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great effect, or were you really covered in feathers?  Anyway, I think this would have been a little better framed somewhat differently, but it''s pretty incredible so a 9 from me.</td>', 'Great effect, or were you really covered in feathers?  Anyway, I think this would have been a little better framed somewhat differently, but it''s pretty incredible so a 9 from me.', '2006-03-12 14:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221950, 305184, 7322, '<td valign="top">Eyeew! Why is everyone choosing peanut butter and jello? I have a hangover and this isn''t helping. Nice lighting and exposure. I''m not sure about the strong vertical format though. I feel like I should see more space to the left of the frame and less at the bottom.</td>', 'Eyeew! Why is everyone choosing peanut butter and jello? I have a hangover and this isn''t helping. Nice lighting and exposure. I''m not sure about the strong vertical format though. I feel like I should see more space to the left of the frame and less at the bottom.', '2006-03-12 14:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221957, 305432, 7322, '<td valign="top">The shoes don''t quite say sinner to me. They are nice but not uber sexy or anything. I like the exposure you got for the satin and the features--nice and rich looking. I think the shoes ruin this for me. They just aren''t fabulous enough. Feathery boudouir slippers (mules) would have been very nice against the red satin and you would have killed two birds with one stone. These shoes look a bit serious to me despite the high heel. Nice effort for the time consideration.</td>', 'The shoes don''t quite say sinner to me. They are nice but not uber sexy or anything. I like the exposure you got for the satin and the features--nice and rich looking. I think the shoes ruin this for me. They just aren''t fabulous enough. Feathery boudouir slippers (mules) would have been very nice against the red satin and you would have killed two birds with one stone. These shoes look a bit serious to me despite the high heel. Nice effort for the time consideration.', '2006-03-12 14:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221969, 305173, 44743, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette!  Fun idea for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice silhouette!  Fun idea for this challenge.', '2006-03-12 14:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221973, 305274, 44743, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, nicely implemented!</td>', 'Clever idea, nicely implemented!', '2006-03-12 14:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221975, 305242, 43058, '<td valign="top">That looks disgusting</td>', 'That looks disgusting', '2006-03-12 14:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221976, 305288, 44743, '<td valign="top">A nice, simple approach to this challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'A nice, simple approach to this challenge.  Well done.', '2006-03-12 14:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221977, 305122, 54747, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.  The details are gorgeous.</td>', 'What a great shot.  The details are gorgeous.', '2006-03-12 14:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221979, 305024, 43058, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.</td>', 'I don''t get it.', '2006-03-12 14:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221982, 305339, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a well done portrait in terms of overall composition, lighting, exposure. I think it would work better if her hair was pulled back as it is too similar in texture and tonality to the feather and creates visual confusion. Also, though I realize that bifocals were one of the choices, this doesn''t seem to be a good creative choice to me. Her eyes are luminous and the glasses detract from that and they don''t make sense in the context of the glamourous nature of the portrait that the peacock feather imbues. If it were just a portrait of the girl, the glasses would work because they tell the viewer something about the subject. But the feather makes this less of a personal portrait and more a statement about the photographer''s creative idea so I feel the viewer should see the girl as an anonymous character they can project their own imagination onto. Does this make sense?</td>', 'This is a well done portrait in terms of overall composition, lighting, exposure. I think it would work better if her hair was pulled back as it is too similar in texture and tonality to the feather and creates visual confusion. Also, though I realize that bifocals were one of the choices, this doesn''t seem to be a good creative choice to me. Her eyes are luminous and the glasses detract from that and they don''t make sense in the context of the glamourous nature of the portrait that the peacock feather imbues. If it were just a portrait of the girl, the glasses would work because they tell the viewer something about the subject. But the feather makes this less of a personal portrait and more a statement about the photographer''s creative idea so I feel the viewer should see the girl as an anonymous character they can project their own imagination onto. Does this make sense?', '2006-03-12 14:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221983, 305300, 44743, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  The candlelight was a nice touch.</td>', 'Clever idea.  The candlelight was a nice touch.', '2006-03-12 14:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221984, 305216, 54747, '<td valign="top">It seems like some of the detail was lost on the feathers and shoes, but great framing.</td>', 'It seems like some of the detail was lost on the feathers and shoes, but great framing.', '2006-03-12 14:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221989, 305178, 44743, '<td valign="top">hehe... now that''s dedication!  Fun idea.  Wonder how long this took to clean up? :)</td>', 'hehe... now that''s dedication!  Fun idea.  Wonder how long this took to clean up? :)', '2006-03-12 14:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221992, 305434, 7322, '<td valign="top">There seems to be an extreme curve adjustment that is making it difficult to really make out the shoe. It almost looks as if this were a less than sharp image and the post-processing is an attempt to obscure poor image quality.This just isn''t working for me asthetically.</td>', 'There seems to be an extreme curve adjustment that is making it difficult to really make out the shoe. It almost looks as if this were a less than sharp image and the post-processing is an attempt to obscure poor image quality.This just isn''t working for me asthetically.', '2006-03-12 14:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221994, 305291, 54747, '<td valign="top">the peanuts make this shot a bit too busy for my taste.  Just duck, jello, and peanut butter would have been more simple, less cluttered, I think.</td>', 'the peanuts make this shot a bit too busy for my taste.  Just duck, jello, and peanut butter would have been more simple, less cluttered, I think.', '2006-03-12 14:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221995, 305385, 44743, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I like the patterns of the molds.  Good contrast with the background.</td>', 'Nice!  I like the patterns of the molds.  Good contrast with the background.', '2006-03-12 14:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2221999, 305169, 7322, '<td valign="top">The snow seems a bit of a random choice for this shot which seems better suited to a studio set-up. This looks kind of hastily thought out and thrown together. Decent image quality but to what point?  This just doesn''t provoke any sort of reaction from me other than the thought that the photographer didn''t really have any ideas but wanted to enter the challenge anyway.</td>', 'The snow seems a bit of a random choice for this shot which seems better suited to a studio set-up. This looks kind of hastily thought out and thrown together. Decent image quality but to what point?  This just doesn''t provoke any sort of reaction from me other than the thought that the photographer didn''t really have any ideas but wanted to enter the challenge anyway.', '2006-03-12 15:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222005, 305387, 44743, '<td valign="top">Fun idea.  I bet your subject was more than happy to help you with this shot.  Extra point for the cute bird.</td>', 'Fun idea.  I bet your subject was more than happy to help you with this shot.  Extra point for the cute bird.', '2006-03-12 15:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222007, 305371, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the soft, desaturated color. The composition works nicely. You made good use of two of the objects to create an image that actually makes some sense and works outside the boundaries of the challenge. My only beef is that there is an odd static look to the woman on the bike and I would like it if her hair were pulled back so we can see her face. Her hair blends into the background too much. Also, this is really picky, I know, but I wish she had taken off her bracelets and watch. I would like to see the curved line of her arms unimpeded.  All the bracelets in close conjection to the handlebars give a choppy, cluttered look to that area.</td>', 'I like the soft, desaturated color. The composition works nicely. You made good use of two of the objects to create an image that actually makes some sense and works outside the boundaries of the challenge. My only beef is that there is an odd static look to the woman on the bike and I would like it if her hair were pulled back so we can see her face. Her hair blends into the background too much. Also, this is really picky, I know, but I wish she had taken off her bracelets and watch. I would like to see the curved line of her arms unimpeded.  All the bracelets in close conjection to the handlebars give a choppy, cluttered look to that area.', '2006-03-12 15:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222008, 305242, 54747, '<td valign="top">The shadows seem off to me.  I like the idea, but a cleaner white palette and a more deliberate control of shadow and light would have made this much better, I think.</td>', 'The shadows seem off to me.  I like the idea, but a cleaner white palette and a more deliberate control of shadow and light would have made this much better, I think.', '2006-03-12 15:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222010, 305289, 44743, '<td valign="top">Nice pose... Destined to be another classic!</td>', 'Nice pose... Destined to be another classic!', '2006-03-12 15:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222011, 305413, 7322, '<td valign="top">Why were so many people drawn to the peanut butter &amp; jello combination? YUCK! This is well done. I like the yellow background and the lighting looks well done. There is an odd glare or white smudgy area in the area beyond the chair that detracts from the otherwise high quality of the image.</td>', 'Why were so many people drawn to the peanut butter & jello combination? YUCK! This is well done. I like the yellow background and the lighting looks well done. There is an odd glare or white smudgy area in the area beyond the chair that detracts from the otherwise high quality of the image.', '2006-03-12 15:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222016, 305144, 44743, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting / tone of the image.  Not quite sure about the bicycle / peanut butter combo, though.</td>', 'I like the lighting / tone of the image.  Not quite sure about the bicycle / peanut butter combo, though.', '2006-03-12 15:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222019, 305395, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m looking and looking and still I only see one object. Well, their are two shoes but if that was what you were thinking I think it shows a lack of imagination and misses the point of the challenge which was to flex some creative muscle. This is hardly creative or imaginative.</td>', 'I''m looking and looking and still I only see one object. Well, their are two shoes but if that was what you were thinking I think it shows a lack of imagination and misses the point of the challenge which was to flex some creative muscle. This is hardly creative or imaginative.', '2006-03-12 15:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222020, 305433, 54747, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very clever, and perfect choice for a backdrop color.</td>', 'Great shot, very clever, and perfect choice for a backdrop color.', '2006-03-12 15:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222021, 305088, 52957, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, but I think after having gone through all the trouble getting the feathers on the girl you could have tried to make the pose and expression of the girl more interesting. To me, the composition looks a bit boring and it could have been such an amazing image.</td>', 'I love the idea, but I think after having gone through all the trouble getting the feathers on the girl you could have tried to make the pose and expression of the girl more interesting. To me, the composition looks a bit boring and it could have been such an amazing image.', '2006-03-12 15:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222022, 305345, 44743, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great idea.  Nicely done.', '2006-03-12 15:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222023, 305094, 52957, '<td valign="top">Yes that is real cool!! Well done</td>', 'Yes that is real cool!! Well done', '2006-03-12 15:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222027, 305428, 52957, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but it just looks a bit unimaginative and old fashioned. A more sexy background and interesting lighting would have done the trick.</td>', 'Nice idea, but it just looks a bit unimaginative and old fashioned. A more sexy background and interesting lighting would have done the trick.', '2006-03-12 15:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222029, 305156, 52957, '<td valign="top">nice colorful shot</td>', 'nice colorful shot', '2006-03-12 15:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222030, 305168, 7322, '<td valign="top">Fun idea for combining pb and jello and nowhere near as nausea inducing as some I''ve seen so far. I think the blob of jello on the jar was one detail too many. It doesn''t make sense and it doesn''t add to the composition. This leaves something to be desired in terms of exposure and image quality---the jar looks nice and sharp and the color is good, if a bit contrasty but the desert dish is out of focus at the bottom and the whipped cream blends into the background and it is too contrasty. Also, the color of the peanut butter is off. What I''m seeing in my viewer looks more like nutella than peanut butter. It is way too brown. It looks brown on the label of the jar also. Overall, a nice effort.</td>', 'Fun idea for combining pb and jello and nowhere near as nausea inducing as some I''ve seen so far. I think the blob of jello on the jar was one detail too many. It doesn''t make sense and it doesn''t add to the composition. This leaves something to be desired in terms of exposure and image quality---the jar looks nice and sharp and the color is good, if a bit contrasty but the desert dish is out of focus at the bottom and the whipped cream blends into the background and it is too contrasty. Also, the color of the peanut butter is off. What I''m seeing in my viewer looks more like nutella than peanut butter. It is way too brown. It looks brown on the label of the jar also. Overall, a nice effort.', '2006-03-12 15:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222032, 305405, 52957, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love the angle you took the picture from ...</td>', 'Great shot, I love the angle you took the picture from ...', '2006-03-12 15:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222033, 305411, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the placement of the shoe near the tire but I like the high key look and even though I generally don''t like selective desat, I think it works here. A good effort.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the placement of the shoe near the tire but I like the high key look and even though I generally don''t like selective desat, I think it works here. A good effort.', '2006-03-12 15:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222038, 305380, 52957, '<td valign="top">Funny!! Dont we just love dogs?? I think there would have been an improvement if you would have covered the shoes with peanut butter and let the dog lick it off</td>', 'Funny!! Dont we just love dogs?? I think there would have been an improvement if you would have covered the shoes with peanut butter and let the dog lick it off', '2006-03-12 15:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222040, 305173, 52957, '<td valign="top">Nice one !</td>', 'Nice one !', '2006-03-12 15:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222041, 305289, 52957, '<td valign="top">Love it ... what a funny image !!</td>', 'Love it ... what a funny image !!', '2006-03-12 15:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222042, 305359, 52957, '<td valign="top">well done !!</td>', 'well done !!', '2006-03-12 15:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222045, 305056, 52957, '<td valign="top">Great Shot !!</td>', 'Great Shot !!', '2006-03-12 15:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222048, 305240, 7322, '<td valign="top">Bleah...another pb &amp; lime jello combo. My poor stomach. This is a nice simple composition but the objects just aren''t presented in an appealing way. The colors are just unpleasant and there is nothing to relieve the viewer''s eye. I think a different color background, maybe a rich red would have added much needed visual dynamic range and made the browns and swampy green warm neutral accents.</td>', 'Bleah...another pb & lime jello combo. My poor stomach. This is a nice simple composition but the objects just aren''t presented in an appealing way. The colors are just unpleasant and there is nothing to relieve the viewer''s eye. I think a different color background, maybe a rich red would have added much needed visual dynamic range and made the browns and swampy green warm neutral accents.', '2006-03-12 15:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222063, 305434, 52957, '<td valign="top">nice shot I love the color !!</td>', 'nice shot I love the color !!', '2006-03-12 15:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222067, 305289, 52925, '<td valign="top">Eek!!</td>', 'Eek!!', '2006-03-12 15:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222085, 305429, 7322, '<td valign="top">Another attempt to get around using two of the objects in a creative way. I''m not buying it. The point of this challenge seems to be to flex your creative muscle by using two seemingly unlrelated objects to compose a great photo. <br/> How did you challenge yourself creatively by taking a photo of two bicycles? <br/> <br/>Ordinarily, I would say these two bikes have good picture possibilities. This rather straight-on, literal recording of the scene doesn''t seem to have explored that potential very thouroughly, however. This photo doesn''t look as if much thought went into composing it beyond ''see it, snap-it, move on''. This impression, combined with the photographer''s apparent unwillingess to challenge him/herself by adhering to the spirit of the challenge, makes me feel like this photo doesn''t merit much, even outside the challenge.</td>', 'Another attempt to get around using two of the objects in a creative way. I''m not buying it. The point of this challenge seems to be to flex your creative muscle by using two seemingly unlrelated objects to compose a great photo.  How did you challenge yourself creatively by taking a photo of two bicycles?  Ordinarily, I would say these two bikes have good picture possibilities. This rather straight-on, literal recording of the scene doesn''t seem to have explored that potential very thouroughly, however. This photo doesn''t look as if much thought went into composing it beyond ''see it, snap-it, move on''. This impression, combined with the photographer''s apparent unwillingess to challenge him/herself by adhering to the spirit of the challenge, makes me feel like this photo doesn''t merit much, even outside the challenge.', '2006-03-12 15:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222102, 305278, 43774, '<td valign="top">Excellent clear shot, best in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent clear shot, best in the challenge!', '2006-03-12 15:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222103, 305205, 43774, '<td valign="top">Really clear, great shot.</td>', 'Really clear, great shot.', '2006-03-12 15:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222104, 305212, 43774, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, love the burst of red and the clarity.</td>', 'Excellent shot, love the burst of red and the clarity.', '2006-03-12 15:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222106, 305056, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m only seeing one of the items here. I''m guessing you used peanut butter as glue for the feathers but it just isn''t clear by this image, therefore, the peanut butter (or maybe jello?) isn''t an integral part of the composition--It would seem to be playing a ''behind-the-scenes'' technical role. Maybe if you had used color?</td>', 'I''m only seeing one of the items here. I''m guessing you used peanut butter as glue for the feathers but it just isn''t clear by this image, therefore, the peanut butter (or maybe jello?) isn''t an integral part of the composition--It would seem to be playing a ''behind-the-scenes'' technical role. Maybe if you had used color?', '2006-03-12 15:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2222107, 305385, 43774, '<td valign="top">I love those dishes! This is a great shot.</td>', 'I love those dishes! This is a great shot.', '2006-03-12 15:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
