(2223086, 305289, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you got a new sofa and that you covered your butt this time.  I only wish you covered up your give-a-way tattoo. It lost anon perspective for me, which I hold to high standard in challenge entries when voting, so that hurt you tremendously with my vote. My helpful comment to you would be to stay away from plaid briefs, and to get a high heel that fits. :)<br/> <br/>LOL..I wanted to add that my son was talking to me when I happened to bring  up your photo on my second go through. He immediately stopped talking, had a look on his face like a deer in the headlights and said "what the!".   He then began to laugh and asked what in the WORLD this man was doing. I said he had to take a photo using two items and I told him the choices.  All he did was laugh and say "mommy, he looks like a girl!"<br/> <br/>Fotomann, you sure do know how to make others smile, so there is your ribbon, graphic blue/red/yellow or not.</td>', 'I''m glad you got a new sofa and that you covered your butt this time.  I only wish you covered up your give-a-way tattoo. It lost anon perspective for me, which I hold to high standard in challenge entries when voting, so that hurt you tremendously with my vote. My helpful comment to you would be to stay away from plaid briefs, and to get a high heel that fits. :) LOL..I wanted to add that my son was talking to me when I happened to bring  up your photo on my second go through. He immediately stopped talking, had a look on his face like a deer in the headlights and said "what the!".   He then began to laugh and asked what in the WORLD this man was doing. I said he had to take a photo using two items and I told him the choices.  All he did was laugh and say "mommy, he looks like a girl!" Fotomann, you sure do know how to make others smile, so there is your ribbon, graphic blue/red/yellow or not.', '2006-03-12 23:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2223092, 305094, 47117, '<td valign="top">You have now used your Pug in 10 entries including this one to date.  This is more becoming a signature on your entries then an anon entry.  I started your photo at a 5 vote. You lost one point due to not having bifocals I can easily tell are bifocals, and you lost another point for disrespecting the anon perspective and in hopes of receiving a score based on the popularity of your dog, which you consistantly bring up in forum discussion to point that out to those that aren''t aware it is your dog.  Your score by me was a 3.  It would have been a 2, but I like the color tones of the wood.  My helpful comment to you would be to try in the future to be a bit more creative.  Not that your dog isn''t cute, as I have voted it high in the past when I first saw it, but now it is becoming flagrantly disrespecting the anon perspective.<br/> <br/>OH, I wanted to add that it made my son smile as I was making my second pass through the photos.  He said "oh my God, a dog eating peanut butter and wearing glasses?" He said -  "Mannnnnnnnn" and laughed hard! LOL....</td>', 'You have now used your Pug in 10 entries including this one to date.  This is more becoming a signature on your entries then an anon entry.  I started your photo at a 5 vote. You lost one point due to not having bifocals I can easily tell are bifocals, and you lost another point for disrespecting the anon perspective and in hopes of receiving a score based on the popularity of your dog, which you consistantly bring up in forum discussion to point that out to those that aren''t aware it is your dog.  Your score by me was a 3.  It would have been a 2, but I like the color tones of the wood.  My helpful comment to you would be to try in the future to be a bit more creative.  Not that your dog isn''t cute, as I have voted it high in the past when I first saw it, but now it is becoming flagrantly disrespecting the anon perspective. OH, I wanted to add that it made my son smile as I was making my second pass through the photos.  He said "oh my God, a dog eating peanut butter and wearing glasses?" He said -  "Mannnnnnnnn" and laughed hard! LOL....', '2006-03-12 23:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
