(2225243, 305300, 25218, '<td valign="top">It''s not clear to me what the "ink" is - is it peanut butter? If so, perhaps leaving it in its original packaging would have helped. The focus seems soft, and the hot spot of the candle flame really pulls the eye. But it''s a clever idea - good effort, keep trying!</td>', 'It''s not clear to me what the "ink" is - is it peanut butter? If so, perhaps leaving it in its original packaging would have helped. The focus seems soft, and the hot spot of the candle flame really pulls the eye. But it''s a clever idea - good effort, keep trying!', '2006-03-13 17:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
