(2225269, 305072, 25218, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot - you composed it nicely. The focus could be sharper, though. Also, I''m not loving the off-white background. I would adjust the white balance on the camera, or, actually, since I never seem to be able get the white balance correct in the camera, what I really would do is color correct it during post-processing, so that the background &amp; the feather were true white.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot - you composed it nicely. The focus could be sharper, though. Also, I''m not loving the off-white background. I would adjust the white balance on the camera, or, actually, since I never seem to be able get the white balance correct in the camera, what I really would do is color correct it during post-processing, so that the background & the feather were true white.', '2006-03-13 18:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
