(2238881, 305138, 50674, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by fotomann_forever:</b></div><hr/><i> Where did you get all these pink feathers? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Found them in an abandoned house at the harbour here in Copenhagen. I have a feeling it was a crime scene (photo-shooting).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-19 11:41:26.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by fotomann_forever: Where did you get all these pink feathers?  Found them in an abandoned house at the harbour here in Copenhagen. I have a feeling it was a crime scene (photo-shooting).', '2006-03-19 11:40:55.000000', '2006-03-19 11:41:26.000000', 0),
