(2239301, 305405, 24940, '<td valign="top">This is a superb photograph on so many levels...  And the title just makes it that much better!<br/> <br/>It looks so natural and spontaneous that few would guess that it was so painstakingly set up.  Even the slightly out-of-focus areas add to the illusion of it being one of those serendipitous "grab" shots - making it all the more fun to look at.<br/> <br/><b>Excellent</b> work and congratulations on your BLUE!</td>', 'This is a superb photograph on so many levels...  And the title just makes it that much better! It looks so natural and spontaneous that few would guess that it was so painstakingly set up.  Even the slightly out-of-focus areas add to the illusion of it being one of those serendipitous "grab" shots - making it all the more fun to look at. Excellent work and congratulations on your BLUE!', '2006-03-19 15:46:23.000000', NULL, 0),
