(2241315, 305094, 37252, '<td valign="top">Thanks for another top 20 !! Whoo Hoo. <br/> <br/>This was a bit harder shot then the others as Napoloen has no nose to speak of and the glasses wouldn''t stay on him. I ended up tying thread to each of the arms and then tied them on him. You can see the end of the thread sticking off on the right, but under basic rules I couldn''t cl,one it out.<br/>As for the peanut butter treat, yes he and the other 5 doggies here got to share it afterwards. They all love peanut butter.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-20 08:47:50.</i></td>', 'Thanks for another top 20 !! Whoo Hoo.  This was a bit harder shot then the others as Napoloen has no nose to speak of and the glasses wouldn''t stay on him. I ended up tying thread to each of the arms and then tied them on him. You can see the end of the thread sticking off on the right, but under basic rules I couldn''t cl,one it out.As for the peanut butter treat, yes he and the other 5 doggies here got to share it afterwards. They all love peanut butter.', '2006-03-20 08:46:35.000000', '2006-03-20 08:47:50.000000', 0),
(2241669, 305212, 32378, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon.  This is a great shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon.  This is a great shot.', '2006-03-20 12:14:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2241733, 305088, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!</td>', 'Congratulations!', '2006-03-20 12:39:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2242148, 305182, 43148, '<td valign="top">I certainly missed again here, oh well, twas meant to be a not "pretty" shot, as you may see it the morning after the night before, sort of like a police or newspaper pic. Did NOT want to pretty it up, and a couple people got it, obviously, but I missed by a mile with most. Oh well, LOL. The ripped plate was supposed to represent the fact he/she was so badly off, could not find a knife, used the glasses as a spreader and ripped the plate with the edge of the glasses. They are real bifocals, btw, and after carefully cleaning them with non abrasive cloth and HOT water, very usable now. On my face as I type this. Thanks to all that left comments, can understand why it did so poorly, ALMOST got me my first ribbon though!! LOL Second place is no good for BAD, still bad and no ribbon!!<br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'I certainly missed again here, oh well, twas meant to be a not "pretty" shot, as you may see it the morning after the night before, sort of like a police or newspaper pic. Did NOT want to pretty it up, and a couple people got it, obviously, but I missed by a mile with most. Oh well, LOL. The ripped plate was supposed to represent the fact he/she was so badly off, could not find a knife, used the glasses as a spreader and ripped the plate with the edge of the glasses. They are real bifocals, btw, and after carefully cleaning them with non abrasive cloth and HOT water, very usable now. On my face as I type this. Thanks to all that left comments, can understand why it did so poorly, ALMOST got me my first ribbon though!! LOL Second place is no good for BAD, still bad and no ribbon!! Jacque', '2006-03-20 16:11:47.000000', NULL, 0),
