(2242306, 305094, 47117, '<td valign="top">This was an advanced editing challenge.  You could have cloned out the string. It was the reason why I almost gave you a 2, due to technicals like that that passed by some others who are usually very astute. I gave you a 3 because I liked the tones overall of the wood. However, no need to worry as I once told you. My vote is really of no matter. As you can see, all of your friends made the right comments and votes anyway, and to the right person. Napoleon conquers again, and again, and again.....! Congrats on your top 20!! :)</td>', 'This was an advanced editing challenge.  You could have cloned out the string. It was the reason why I almost gave you a 2, due to technicals like that that passed by some others who are usually very astute. I gave you a 3 because I liked the tones overall of the wood. However, no need to worry as I once told you. My vote is really of no matter. As you can see, all of your friends made the right comments and votes anyway, and to the right person. Napoleon conquers again, and again, and again.....! Congrats on your top 20!! :)', '2006-03-20 17:19:45.000000', NULL, 0),
